= Stanisław Dubois

Dubois enters the adviser pool in 1930. He represents Lewica PPS and concentrates on socialist youth and workers' self-defence.

- @organize_youth
- @workers_self_defence
- @root: Return to main

@organize_youth
title: Organize Socialist Youth
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; young_socialists += 1; lewica_strength += 5; lewica_dissent -= 3; workers_pps += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_pps += 1*(1-dissent); radicalization += 1

Youth organizing strengthens Lewica and recruits future activists without automatically adding members to the militia.

@workers_self_defence
title: Workers' Self-Defence
subtitle: Make the Milicja PPS or Akcja Socjalistyczna card available immediately.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pps_militia_timer = 0; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: reichsbanner

Dubois creates an opportunity to act, but does not grant free manpower or militancy. The player must choose and fund any recruitment, training, cooperation or reorganization.
